   "say": "Start with the first window, sum eight, and remember it as the best. Now slide right. The two falls out, so subtract two. The new one comes in, so add one. Eight minus two plus one is seven. Slide again. One out, three in: nine. That's a new best. Slide once more. Five out, two in: six. Each step costs two operations, however big the window is."
