    },
    {
     "cue": "records the best",
     "lines": [
      6
     ]
    }
   ],
   "notes": [
    {
     "line": 3,
     "inside": true,
     "text": "one pass: O(n)",
     "tone": "good",
     "cue": "One pass"
    }
   ],
   "say": "Here it is in code. Each loop adds the element entering on the right. Once the window is full, it subtracts the one leaving on the left. Then it records the best. One pass, so O of n time and O of one extra space, instead of O of n times k for recounting."
